## Phase 0 — Bootstrap (Week 1) · “V0 foundation”

**Goal:** Empty Next app becomes a multi-surface shell wired to a **new** live Supabase project.

### Agent checklist

- [ ] Create dedicated Supabase project named `hoardings360` (or `h360-prod` / `h360-dev`)
- [ ] Point Cursor Supabase MCP at **that** project only for this repo
- [ ] Enable extensions: `postgis`, `pgcrypto`, `uuid-ossp` (as needed)
- [ ] Add `.env.local` from `.env.example` (URL + anon + service role server-only)
- [ ] Install: `@supabase/supabase-js`, `@supabase/ssr`, map lib later
- [ ] App shell: auth layout, `(market)` `(manage)` `(field)` route groups
- [ ] Design tokens + shared UI primitives
- [ ] Folder layout:

```
app/
  (market)/...
  (manage)/...
  (field)/...
  (admin)/...
  api/...                 # Route Handlers only when Edge Fn not enough
lib/supabase/             # browser.ts, server.ts, admin.ts
lib/domain/               # types, status machines
components/
supabase/migrations/      # numbered SQL applied to LIVE project
supabase/functions/       # Edge Functions deployed to LIVE
```

**Exit:** Login works against live Auth; empty Manage shell loads; migration pipeline documented.

