## Phase 3 — Public Marketplace (Months 6–8) · V2.0 · M25–M29 + M33 verify

**No inventory-scale gate.** Face/owner count is a growth KPI, not a launch blocker. Open Market when the product path works and public data is safe.

**Launch readiness (product, not scale):**

- Publishable projection only — no floor rates, costs, or client names on public paths
- Expired mandatory clearance still auto-unpublishes (audited override only)
- Browse → listing → enquiry (and hold if in scope) works end-to-end
- Owner inbox can answer enquiries; SLA is measurable when you choose to enforce it
- RLS + advisors clean; DPDP/consent and pen test tracked under production readiness below

### Build

- Marketplace projection table/view refreshed by events / cron Edge Fn
- Map + filters + listing detail + cart + split multi-owner enquiry
- Holds; price-on-request countdown
- Owner enquiry / hold / marketplace settings inboxes
- SEO landings (SSR/ISR); CMS + verification in Super Admin

**Exit:** Public browse + qualified enquiry path live; owners can respond from Manage.

