## Production readiness (continuous)

| Gate | When |
|------|------|
| RLS + advisors clean | Every migration |
| Backup / PITR on | Before V1.0 private beta |
| Staging = Supabase branch or second live project | Before V2.0 |
| Observability (Sentry + Supabase logs) | V1.0 |
| DPDP / consent / India residency | Before V2.0 |
| Pen test + WAF | V2.0 gate |

## What kills the roadmap

- Leaking floor rates, costs, or client names onto public Market paths
- Writing H360 schema into another company’s Supabase project
- Skipping `board_faces` or compliance-as-many-records
- Hardcoding status strings in UI instead of config/state machines
- Computing availability in two places instead of `occupancy_periods`
- Blocking Market launch on arbitrary face/owner inventory quotas
